    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good baseline, very professional. \n\nthough, checking the internal feedback, the sentiment score on that one came back pretty low (around 0.1). it's almost a bit too \"cold\" for our brand identity. we want users to feel like we're on their side, even when things go wrong. \n\ncan you try a version that's a bit more encouraging? we still need to be serious and not \"yay! 🎉\" about it, but maybe find a way to lift that positivity score a bit higher without losing the professionalism. just try to make it feel a little more supportive.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
