      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Sorry to see that your transfer failed due to insufficient funds. We're here to help you get back on track. Please review your account balance and consider alternative payment options, such as setting up a direct debit or using our budgeting tools to help manage your finances. If you're experiencing financial difficulties, our support team is here to provide guidance and support for urgent expenses.\"\n\nI've made a few adjustments to focus more on the solutions and support aspects, while still being clear and professional. The phrase \"get back on track\" is intended to convey a sense of empowerment and support, rather than simply apologizing for the issue. I've also added a few words to emphasize the availability of support and guidance, which should help to lift the sentiment score.",
